9:["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-8","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xl text-gray-700","children":"A strong notary business is built on more than just a commission and a stamp. These nine books cover the skills that actually move the business forward: loan signings, marketing, specialty work, document familiarity, and better decision-making in the field."}]}]
a:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-lg max-w-none","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"my-8","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/images/essential-notary-books-featured.png","alt":"9 essential books for mobile notaries and loan signing agents","className":"w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto"}]}],[["$","div","Sign and Thrive: How to Make Six Figures As a Mobile Notary and Loan Signing Agent",{"className":"mb-12 border-b pb-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-notary-navy mb-4","children":"Sign and Thrive: How to Make Six Figures As a Mobile Notary and Loan Signing Agent"}],[["$","p","Bill Soroka's Sign and Thrive is still one of the most practical books for notaries who want a clearer picture of how mobile notary and loan signing work fits together day to day. It covers marketing, client experience, and the habits that make the work easier to manage over time.",{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-4","children":"Bill Soroka's Sign and Thrive is still one of the most practical books for notaries who want a clearer picture of how mobile notary and loan signing work fits together day to day. It covers marketing, client experience, and the habits that make the work easier to manage over time."}],["$","p","What makes this one useful is that it looks beyond the commission itself. It does not just explain what the work is. It helps you think through routines, service standards, and the kind of structure that makes you feel more confident in the field.",{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-4","children":"What makes this one useful is that it looks beyond the commission itself. It does not just explain what the work is. It helps you think through routines, service standards, and the kind of structure that makes you feel more confident in the field."}]],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://amzn.to/4pt6S9E","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"inline-block bg-notary-navy text-white px-6 py-3 font-semibold hover:bg-opacity-90 transition","children":"View on Amazon"}]]}],["$","div","The Best Kept Secret In The Real Estate Industry: How To Become A Successful Notary Loan Signing Agent",{"className":"mb-12 border-b pb-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-notary-navy mb-4","children":"The Best Kept Secret In The Real Estate Industry: How To Become A Successful Notary Loan Signing Agent"}],[["$","p","Mark Wills' book remains one of the better entry points for people who are specifically interested in loan signing work. It frames the opportunity clearly, explains what makes the niche different, and gives newer notaries a simple path into work that often feels confusing from the outside.",{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-4","children":"Mark Wills' book remains one of the better entry points for people who are specifically interested in loan signing work. It frames the opportunity clearly, explains what makes the niche different, and gives newer notaries a simple path into work that often feels confusing from the outside."}],["$","p","If your goal is to understand the loan signing side of the business and decide whether it fits your income goals, this is still worth reading. It pairs especially well with hands-on training because it helps you understand the why behind the work.",{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-4","children":"If your goal is to understand the loan signing side of the business and decide whether it fits your income goals, this is still worth reading. It pairs especially well with hands-on training because it helps you understand the why behind the work."}]],"$L13"]}],"$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a"]]}]
