14:["$","div","$$50k to Sign Your Name: A Definitive Guide to Becoming a Mobile Signing Agent",{"className":"mb-12 border-b pb-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-notary-navy mb-4","children":"$$50k to Sign Your Name: A Definitive Guide to Becoming a Mobile Signing Agent"}],[["$","p","This book is a straightforward overview of the mobile signing agent path, especially for people trying to understand the economics of the business. It breaks down the opportunity in a simple way and helps readers think through time, expenses, and the workflow of loan signing appointments.",{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-4","children":"This book is a straightforward overview of the mobile signing agent path, especially for people trying to understand the economics of the business. It breaks down the opportunity in a simple way and helps readers think through time, expenses, and the workflow of loan signing appointments."}],["$","p","It is useful because it keeps the conversation practical. If you want a book that helps you picture what the job looks like in the real world and what it might take to make it worthwhile, this one belongs on the list.",{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-4","children":"It is useful because it keeps the conversation practical. If you want a book that helps you picture what the job looks like in the real world and what it might take to make it worthwhile, this one belongs on the list."}]],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://amzn.to/4gCzXgp","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"inline-block bg-notary-navy text-white px-6 py-3 font-semibold hover:bg-opacity-90 transition","children":"View on Amazon"}]]}]
15:["$","div","Just Win! How To Be A Great Notary Public: A Business Guide For Mobile Notaries and Loan Signing Agents",{"className":"mb-12 border-b pb-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-notary-navy mb-4","children":"Just Win! How To Be A Great Notary Public: A Business Guide For Mobile Notaries and Loan Signing Agents"}],[["$","p","Rhonda DeYampert's Just Win! is a practical guide for notaries who want help turning a commission into steady, organized work. It covers mindset, resourcefulness, and the basics you need once you are ready to move beyond the earliest setup stage.",{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-4","children":"Rhonda DeYampert's Just Win! is a practical guide for notaries who want help turning a commission into steady, organized work. It covers mindset, resourcefulness, and the basics you need once you are ready to move beyond the earliest setup stage."}],["$","p","One of the strengths of this book is that it feels grounded in experience. It is written for notaries who want practical direction, not fluff, and it can help you tighten your systems early instead of learning every lesson the hard way.",{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-4","children":"One of the strengths of this book is that it feels grounded in experience. It is written for notaries who want practical direction, not fluff, and it can help you tighten your systems early instead of learning every lesson the hard way."}]],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://amzn.to/4gZuuk3","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"inline-block bg-notary-navy text-white px-6 py-3 font-semibold hover:bg-opacity-90 transition","children":"View on Amazon"}]]}]
16:["$","div","Notary Marketing",{"className":"mb-12 border-b pb-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-notary-navy mb-4","children":"Notary Marketing"}],[["$","p","This updated marketing-focused addition replaces the older Notary Marketing 2019 recommendation. The value here is obvious: many notaries know how to complete the work, but far fewer know how to consistently attract new clients and stand out in a crowded market.",{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-4","children":"This updated marketing-focused addition replaces the older Notary Marketing 2019 recommendation. The value here is obvious: many notaries know how to complete the work, but far fewer know how to consistently attract new clients and stand out in a crowded market."}],["$","p","Based on the synopsis, this book leans into scripts, networking, sales techniques, and referrals. That makes it especially useful for general notary work and for anyone who wants more direct outreach ideas instead of relying only on platforms.",{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-4","children":"Based on the synopsis, this book leans into scripts, networking, sales techniques, and referrals. That makes it especially useful for general notary work and for anyone who wants more direct outreach ideas instead of relying only on platforms."}]],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://amzn.to/4w8V7aR","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"inline-block bg-notary-navy text-white px-6 py-3 font-semibold hover:bg-opacity-90 transition","children":"View on Amazon"}]]}]
17:["$","div","Start Your Notary Public & Loan Signing Agent Business: The Insiders Guide to Starting a Six-Figure Notary Side Hustle",{"className":"mb-12 border-b pb-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-notary-navy mb-4","children":"Start Your Notary Public & Loan Signing Agent Business: The Insiders Guide to Starting a Six-Figure Notary Side Hustle"}],[["$","p","This is a strong option for readers who want a broader startup perspective around notary and loan signing work. It focuses on early setup, insurance, common mistakes, and what it takes to get moving without feeling lost.",{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-4","children":"This is a strong option for readers who want a broader startup perspective around notary and loan signing work. It focuses on early setup, insurance, common mistakes, and what it takes to get moving without feeling lost."}],["$","p","If you are in the early stages and want a book that combines opportunity, setup, and practical guidance in one place, this is a solid pick for your shelf.",{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-4","children":"If you are in the early stages and want a book that combines opportunity, setup, and practical guidance in one place, this is a solid pick for your shelf."}]],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://amzn.to/3QW2uTN","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"inline-block bg-notary-navy text-white px-6 py-3 font-semibold hover:bg-opacity-90 transition","children":"View on Amazon"}]]}]
18:["$","div","Loan Documents Cheat Sheet: Descriptions of Loan Documents with images! (ESA Notary Academy)",{"className":"mb-12 border-b pb-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-notary-navy mb-4","children":"Loan Documents Cheat Sheet: Descriptions of Loan Documents with images! (ESA Notary Academy)"}],[["$","p","This is one of the most practical additions on the list because it helps bridge the gap between theory and live signings. A lot of newer notaries freeze up when they are sitting in front of a borrower and trying to remember what a document is or how to describe it confidently.",{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-4","children":"This is one of the most practical additions on the list because it helps bridge the gap between theory and live signings. A lot of newer notaries freeze up when they are sitting in front of a borrower and trying to remember what a document is or how to describe it confidently."}],["$","p","The compact format, document images, and short descriptions make this a great desk reference or bag reference. It is especially helpful for newer signing agents who want a confidence booster before and during appointments.",{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-4","children":"The compact format, document images, and short descriptions make this a great desk reference or bag reference. It is especially helpful for newer signing agents who want a confidence booster before and during appointments."}]],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://amzn.to/4yqvOlW","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"inline-block bg-notary-navy text-white px-6 py-3 font-semibold hover:bg-opacity-90 transition","children":"View on Amazon"}]]}]
19:["$","div","Beyond Loan Signings: The Ultimate Guide to Monetizing Your Notary Commission with Specialty Work",{"className":"mb-12 border-b pb-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-notary-navy mb-4","children":"Beyond Loan Signings: The Ultimate Guide to Monetizing Your Notary Commission with Specialty Work"}],[["$","p","This is a smart addition because it pushes beyond the usual \"become a signing agent\" conversation. Beyond Loan Signings explores specialty work, alternative service lines, and adjacent services that can make your schedule more flexible and less dependent on one type of appointment.",{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-4","children":"This is a smart addition because it pushes beyond the usual \"become a signing agent\" conversation. Beyond Loan Signings explores specialty work, alternative service lines, and adjacent services that can make your schedule more flexible and less dependent on one type of appointment."}],["$","p","That matters because not every market behaves the same way, and not every notary wants to depend only on loan signings. If you want to diversify into areas like apostille work, fingerprinting, inspections, family law appointments, or other specialty niches, this book is highly relevant.",{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-4","children":"That matters because not every market behaves the same way, and not every notary wants to depend only on loan signings. If you want to diversify into areas like apostille work, fingerprinting, inspections, family law appointments, or other specialty niches, this book is highly relevant."}]],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://amzn.to/4fdxcQg","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"inline-block bg-notary-navy text-white px-6 py-3 font-semibold hover:bg-opacity-90 transition","children":"View on Amazon"}]]}]
1a:["$","div","The Novice-Friendly State I. D. Verification Guide Book 2026: Understanding Identity Checks, Document Features, Verification Basics, and Common Identification Review Practices",{"className":"mb-12","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-notary-navy mb-4","children":"The Novice-Friendly State I. D. Verification Guide Book 2026: Understanding Identity Checks, Document Features, Verification Basics, and Common Identification Review Practices"}],[["$","p","This replaces the older I.D. checking recommendation with a more beginner-friendly resource. The strength of this book is that it helps readers build awareness around identification review without pretending to replace official policy, legal requirements, or formal training.",{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-4","children":"This replaces the older I.D. checking recommendation with a more beginner-friendly resource. The strength of this book is that it helps readers build awareness around identification review without pretending to replace official policy, legal requirements, or formal training."}],["$","p","For notaries, that makes it a helpful support resource. It can sharpen your awareness of document features, common review habits, and frequent verification mistakes, which is valuable for newer notaries who want to be more careful and consistent with ID-related decisions.",{"className":"text-gray-700 mb-4","children":"For notaries, that makes it a helpful support resource. It can sharpen your awareness of document features, common review habits, and frequent verification mistakes, which is valuable for newer notaries who want to be more careful and consistent with ID-related decisions."}]],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://amzn.to/4bNRfUn","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"inline-block bg-notary-navy text-white px-6 py-3 font-semibold hover:bg-opacity-90 transition","children":"View on Amazon"}]]}]
